# theahg.co.za is NOT skipped: it answers slowly from the CI runners at times (27 Nov 2026), so the
# workflow waits longer (--timeout 45, --retry-wait-time 10) instead of hiding it.
# Links the readme-links check skips (one regex per line), with the reason.
# gnu.org licence pages time out from the CI runners (v1.166.4 and v1.166.5);
# they are stable and checking them only produces false failures.
^https?://(www\.)?gnu\.org/
